alysis needed and relevant data.\", \"They are easier to record than open-ended questions are.\", \"They automatically produce more usable data.\", \"They shorten the executive summary of the report.\"],\n16:   \"ch1-q19\": [\"Defining the questions that guide the analysis.\", \"Searching for outliers and dealing with null values.\", \"Distributing the final report to management.\", \"Interpreting multiple visualizations together with data.\"],\n17:   \"ch1-q23\": [\"Which raw files should be deleted after the analysis step.\", \"What is being learned from the results of the analysis.\", \"Which software performed the analysis fastest.\", \"Which metrics were collected during Step 2.\"],\n18:   \"ch1-q25\": [\"The introductory paragraph.\", \"The signature of the auditor.\", \"The basis of the opinion.\", \"The opinion of the auditor.\"],\n19:   \"ch1-q27\": [\"They are prepared by the auditor from management's records.\", \"They are the responsibility of the organization's management.\", \"They are jointly certified by management and the auditor.\", \"They are exempt from financial controls once audited by the firm.\"],\n20:   \"ch1-q28\": [\"Preparation of the financial statements.\", \"Approval of management's accounting policies.\", \"Full compliance with the ethical requirements.\", \"Certification of the entity's tax filings.\"],\n21:   \"ch1-q29\": [\"A full transcript of every fieldwork meeting.\", \"A complete record of server configuration changes.\", \"A full summary of employee attendance during the audit period.\", \"A brief preliminary position paper with the top metrics.\"],\n22:   \"ch1-q30\": [\"Reproducible results.\", \"Outcome-oriented.\", \"Context-aware.\", \"Accurate and defensible.\"],\n23:   \"ch1-q31\": [\"Transparent and clear.\", \"Interactive and open dialogue.\", \"Objective and evidence based.\", \"Constructive and forward looking.\"],\n24:   \"ch1-q32\": [\"By the order in which they were discovered.\", \"By threat levels like Critica