ew cycle.\"],\n  \"ch3-q20\": [\"Mitigate the risk impact.\", \"Transfer the whole risk.\", \"Avoid the risk entirely.\", \"Accept the risk as is.\"],\n  \"ch3-q24\": [\"A single decision-making leader.\", \"Minimal documentation kept.\", \"Open dialogue with stakeholders.\", \"A private budget for the team.\"],\n  \"ch3-q25\": [\"Automated vulnerability scanners.\", \"Key Risk Indicators and dashboards.\", \"Automated network mapping software.\", \"Scheduled backup restoration drills.\"]\n}","filePath":"C:\\Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\iasexam\\fix3.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"C:\\Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\iasexam\\fix3.json","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\iasexam\\fix3.json","time":{"start":1789823935909,"end":1789823935928}},"id":"prt_0b9d1cfe1001aJqbnvKuERXpSA","sessionID":"ses_f464447b3ffe6otWPhKUxoCp1k","messageID":"msg_0b9d1cb61001a6SSmAN1qQdcfh"}}
