{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789823953990,"sessionID":"ses_f464447b3ffe6otWPhKUxoCp1k","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_b2323939a4754e57ad59ff41","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\n  \"ch5-q01\": [\"Creating copies of files so the originals can be restored if damaged.\", \"Moving files between network drives to free storage space.\", \"Deleting outdated files to reduce the storage footprint.\", \"Encrypting files so only authorized users can read them.\"],\n  \"ch5-q02\": [\"Fastest to create and uses the least storage.\", \"Slowest to create, fastest to restore, uses most storage.\", \"Copies only data changed since the last backup.\", \"Creates a continuously updated copy with no version history.\"],\n  \"ch5-q03\": [\"Copies all changes since the last full backup.\", \"Creates a real-time copy with no versions.\", \"Copies only data changed since the last backup.\", \"Restores quickly using only one backup set.\"],\n  \"ch5-q05\": [\"A deleted source file is also removed from the mirror copy.\", \"Restore takes longer than with incremental backups.\", \"Storage use grows faster than with differentials.\", \"It cannot be restored after a device failure.\"],\n  \"ch5-q06\": [\"It uses less storage space overall.\", \"Only the full and the latest differential are needed.\", \"It copies less data every single day.\", \"It is stored on a separate backup medium each night.\"],\n  \"ch5-q07\": [\"To confirm that an actual incident has occurred.\", \"To notify law enforcement authorities.\", \"To get the organization ready for a possible incident.\", \"To restore systems from verified backups.\"],\n  \"ch5-q08\": [\"Preparing a forensic jump kit and tools.\", \"Deploying antivirus and EDR software.\", \"Running simulated incident response drills.\", \"Defining Incident Response Team roles.\"],\n  \"ch5-q09\": [\"Maintaining an updated inventory of hardware and software.\", \"Developing an escalation procedure and plan.\", \"Conducting employee security awareness training sessions.\", \"Writing the incident response policy document.\"],\n  \"ch5-q10\": [\"It restores the affected systems from verified backups.\", \"It separates true incidents from false alarms and sets scope.\", \"It assigns owners to the corrective actions.\", \"It eradicates all malware from the affected hosts.\"],\n  \"ch5-q11\": [\"Employee payroll records.\", \"Vendor purchase orders.\", \"Alerts from IDS, IPS, and SIEM.\", \"Employee vacation schedules.\"],\n  \"ch5-q12\": [\"Containing the affected systems quickly.\", \"Deploying short-term containment fixes.\", \"Eradicating the underlying root cause.\", \"Documenting findings for chain of custody.\"],\n  \"ch5-q13\": [\"The phases of notification, response, and recovery.\", \"Phases of detection, containment, and eradication.\", \"Phases of preparation, identification, and recovery.\", \"Phases of containment, eradication, and restoration.\"],\n  \"ch5-q14\": [\"To reduce the total number of final notifications.\", \"So the right people are reached the first time during a crisis.\", \"To keep the incident response team small and focused.\", \"To satisfy insurance policy requirements.\"],\n  \"ch5-q16\": [\"It increases the total recovery budget available.\", \"It limits the damage before the threat spreads.\", \"It prevents all future incidents from occurring.\", \"It replaces the need for full containment steps.\"],\n  \"ch5-q18\": [\"Restoring critical data from verified backups.\", \"Disconnecting compromised devices to stop movement.\", \"Reviewing the lessons learned after an incident.\", \"Drafting the final breach report for management.\"],\n  \"ch5-q19\": [\"Rebuilding the compromised host system.\", \"Updating the incident response plan promptly.\", \"Blocking malicious IPs and closing open ports.\", \"Conducting a full security scan.\"],\n  \"ch5-q20\": [\"Performing a gradual system rollout.\", \"Sending stakeholder notifications first.\", \"Continuing proactive security monitoring now.\", \"Removing backdoors and unauthorized accounts.\"],\n  \"ch5-q21\": [\"A backup taken before the incident and free of malware.\", \"The most recent backup that is available.\", \"A backup created after the eradication.\", \"The first full backup made during system setup.\"],\n  \"ch5-q22\": [\"In the order the systems were attacked first.\", \"In priority order based on the recovery priorities.\", \"All affected systems at the same exact time.\", \"From the newest to the oldest backup copy available.\"],\n  \"ch5-q23\": [\"Obtaining legal approval before live.\", \"Deleting all old logs afterward.\", \"Renewing all software licenses.\", \"Running scans to check for any threats.\"],\n  \"ch5-q24\": [\"Repeating why until you find something fixable.\", \"Reviewing the written backup policy one more time.\", \"Asking who is responsible for it first.\", \"Skipping the initial symptom analysis.\"],\n  \"ch5-q25\": [\"Who made it and where it was stored.\", \"How big it was and how fast it copied.\", \"How much data was lost and how long it was down.\", \"Which vendor produced it and its warranty.\"],\n  \"ch5-q27\": [\"After the incident is contained.\", \"When the report is requested.\", \"The moment the incident is detected.\", \"During the lessons learned meeting.\"],\n  \"ch5-q28\": [\"As a running log of each step with the time taken.\", \"As a summary written after everything is fully resolved.\", \"As a separate report for each department.\", \"As a record of the final findings only.\"],\n  \"ch5-q29\": [\"The official breach notice filed before the legal deadline.\", \"Plain-language guidance written for affected users.\", \"A full technical timeline with root cause and pending fixes.\", \"A short one to two page summary of cost, downtime, and impact.\"],\n  \"ch5-q30\": [\"When the whole investigation is fully finished.\", \"When the incident report is drafted.\", \"When you know or have reason to believe a breach happened.\", \"When all affected users have been fully contacted.\"]\n}","filePath":"C:\\Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\iasexam\\fix5.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"C:\\Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\iasexam\\fix5.json","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\iasexam\\fix5.json","time":{"start":1789823953969,"end":1789823953988}},"id":"prt_0b9d20c6a001SedK5Fx0dfu2Th","sessionID":"ses_f464447b3ffe6otWPhKUxoCp1k","messageID":"msg_0b9d207ae001pBF7SZDZYFn1HQ"}}
